@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557
skinparam activityStartColor #163E52
skinparam activityEndColor #163E52
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title CF-M07 — Read correspondence or deliberately send
start
:CF-M07-S01\nInitiating actor\nUser separately requests\ncorrespondence reading or a\nreviewed send/reply.;
if (CF-M07-S02\nCurrent product/account/resource\nauthority and provider capability\nvalid?) then (yes)
if (CF-M07-S03\nRequest is correspondence reading?) then (yes)
:CF-M07-S04\nSystem\nFetch only permitted intended\nmailbox content;
if (CF-M07-S05\nProvider result confirmed?) then (yes)
:CF-M07-S06\nSystem\nShow permitted read result with\naccount/freshness context;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M07-S07\nSystem\nReport provider failure/unavailabi\nlity/uncertainty; do not invent\ncontent;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M07-S08\nUser\nReview sender, recipients, body,\nreply context and attachments;
if (CF-M07-S09\nFinal intended content/context\nexplicitly confirmed?) then (yes)
:CF-M07-S10\nSystem\nRecheck send capability, exact\ncurrent content and authority;
if (CF-M07-S11\nReview still current and sending\npermitted?) then (yes)
:CF-M07-S12\nSystem\nSubmit one attributable intended\nsend/reply attempt;
if (CF-M07-S13\nProvider confirms acceptance?) then (yes)
:CF-M07-S14\nSystem\nReport provider acceptance only;\ndelivery/read not established;
stop
else (no)
if (CF-M07-S15\nProvider definitely rejects?) then (yes)
:CF-M07-S16\nSystem\nReport rejected attempt; retain\nattributable context;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M07-S17\nSystem\nMark outcome unknown; reconcile\nsame attempt before explicit retry;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
:CF-M07-S18\nSystem\nNo send; changed content requires\nrenewed review or authority;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M07-S19\nSystem\nKeep unsent intent; no implicit\nsend;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
:CF-M07-S20\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
